1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,320
(The Underworld)

2
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:12,080
(Shen Yanlin)

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,940
♪Cruel world, where trust runs thin♪
(Ling Che)

4
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:22,320
♪Blades clash. Who will rise above?♪
(Shuangdao Hui)

5
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:28,040
♪Behind every smile, danger waits♪
(Dongshan Tai)

6
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:30,520
(Fei Liu)

7
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:35,080
♪Know your limits, know your worth♪
(Luo Song)

8
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:39,800
♪Stand strong against the raging tide♪
(Annie)

9
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:44,120
♪Ask how many times I've lost my way♪

10
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Storms rage on the road to power♪

11
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,960
♪Let old promises fade into memory♪

12
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:58,040
♪Alone and fearless, I won't back down♪

13
00:00:58,040 --> 00:01:02,120
♪Power is a crown forged in blood♪

14
00:01:02,120 --> 00:01:09,040
♪Brotherhood is shelter from the storm♪

15
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:15,680
=The Underworld=

16
00:01:15,680 --> 00:01:19,280
=Episode 22=

17
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:24,359
You killed Fei Liu.

18
00:01:44,760 --> 00:01:46,040
You cops need evidence

19
00:01:46,519 --> 00:01:47,640
before you make accusations.

20
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:37,439
Starting now,

21
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:40,319
everything from your academy days
will be erased.

22
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:41,759
You'll have no friends.

23
00:02:42,879 --> 00:02:44,599
You can never contact your family again.

24
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:46,439
Yes.

25
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:07,800
Congratulations, Annie!

26
00:03:15,439 --> 00:03:16,360
All right, back to work.

27
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:17,759
Okay.

28
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:23,319
Congratulations.

29
00:03:24,280 --> 00:03:26,240
And congrats on getting the club back.

30
00:03:45,080 --> 00:03:46,639
Who told you to get Coke?

31
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,360
Sorry, Boss Lin.

32
00:03:55,319 --> 00:03:55,719
Sit.

33
00:03:59,599 --> 00:04:00,520
Forget the Coke.

34
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:01,719
Let's have a drink.

35
00:04:08,759 --> 00:04:11,000
They say we're all born

36
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:12,400
to repay a debt.

37
00:04:13,319 --> 00:04:14,719
But we each owe something different,

38
00:04:15,319 --> 00:04:16,279
so naturally,

39
00:04:17,319 --> 00:04:18,120
we all take different paths.

40
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:19,680
Then what path

41
00:04:20,879 --> 00:04:21,879
do you think I'll take?

42
00:04:22,199 --> 00:04:23,720
Whatever path you choose,

43
00:04:24,519 --> 00:04:25,800
I'll walk it with you.

44
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:41,199
Okay.

45
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:42,480
Got it.

46
00:04:44,199 --> 00:04:46,639
Mr. Wan agreed to meet with you.

47
00:05:10,439 --> 00:05:11,040
Mr. Wan.

48
00:05:11,759 --> 00:05:13,560
This is Mr. Shen Yanlin

49
00:05:13,879 --> 00:05:15,240
of Dongcheng Construction Group.

50
00:05:16,279 --> 00:05:17,519
Nice to meet you, Mr. Wan.

51
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:18,879
Dongcheng Gang's

52
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:20,399
shot-caller?

53
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:21,920
Since when

54
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:23,199
did Dongcheng Gang

55
00:05:23,199 --> 00:05:24,560
get into construction?

56
00:05:26,879 --> 00:05:28,079
I'm new to this, Mr. Wan.

57
00:05:28,639 --> 00:05:30,160
I was hoping to learn from you

58
00:05:31,079 --> 00:05:32,120
and maybe borrow some of your luck.

59
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:33,759
As for me,

60
00:05:34,839 --> 00:05:36,240
I don't tell people how to do things.

61
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:38,319
I only make friends.

62
00:05:39,439 --> 00:05:39,920
I understand.

63
00:05:44,319 --> 00:05:45,360
When I make friends,

64
00:05:45,759 --> 00:05:47,560
I need to know who I'm dealing with.

65
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:56,040
I have another meeting soon.

66
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:57,360
I'll be going.

67
00:05:58,600 --> 00:05:59,240
Mr. Wan.

68
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:00,639
I'll see you out.

69
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:04,319
Here comes Mr. Wan!

70
00:06:04,319 --> 00:06:06,199
Mr. Wan! Mr. Wan!

71
00:06:06,439 --> 00:06:07,680
Please answer the question!

72
00:06:07,680 --> 00:06:09,199
Can you comment?

73
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:11,199
What about the improper land rezoning?

74
00:06:14,319 --> 00:06:15,639
Farmland was rezoned for commercial use!

75
00:06:15,639 --> 00:06:16,240
Mr. Wan!

76
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:17,560
No comment.

77
00:06:19,800 --> 00:06:22,120
Why rezone farmland for commercial use?

78
00:06:22,279 --> 00:06:22,639
Mr. Wan!

79
00:06:23,079 --> 00:06:24,399
Did you profit from it?

80
00:06:25,120 --> 00:06:26,600
Mr. Wan, please respond!

81
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:28,000
Mr. Wan, answer the question!

82
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:29,360
That rezoning violated procedure!

83
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:32,720
Mr. Wan, did you break the rules?

84
00:06:33,879 --> 00:06:34,399
Move!

85
00:06:34,399 --> 00:06:35,600
Enough! Stop filming!

86
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:36,480
Move! Move!

87
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:38,279
Mr. Wan! Mr. Wan!

88
00:06:38,279 --> 00:06:40,399
Stay back! Stop filming!

89
00:06:40,399 --> 00:06:41,800
Mr. Wan, I'll see you out.

90
00:06:43,439 --> 00:06:45,560
That's enough. No more questions.

91
00:06:46,519 --> 00:06:48,120
No more questions!

92
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:49,600
Wait, Mr. Wan!

93
00:06:52,279 --> 00:06:52,839
Mr. Wan.

94
00:06:56,360 --> 00:06:56,959
Mr. Wan.

95
00:06:58,439 --> 00:06:59,839
Chief Xiao...

96
00:07:00,879 --> 00:07:02,040
I can take care of him for you.

97
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:02,759
Shut up.

98
00:07:06,399 --> 00:07:07,360
"Take care of him"?

99
00:07:08,879 --> 00:07:10,800
Politics has its own rules.

100
00:07:11,319 --> 00:07:12,480
This isn't the underworld.

101
00:07:13,439 --> 00:07:14,720
If something happens to him,

102
00:07:15,279 --> 00:07:16,079
those reporters

103
00:07:16,360 --> 00:07:18,920
will swarm like sharks

104
00:07:18,920 --> 00:07:20,160
smelling blood.

105
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:25,600
How can you guarantee I get out clean?

106
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:29,240
Our company does more than use force.

107
00:07:29,959 --> 00:07:31,079
I have my own methods.

108
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:34,399
It comes down to whether

109
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:37,240
you'll give me a chance, Mr. Wan.

110
00:07:56,279 --> 00:07:56,879
Boss Lin.

111
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:58,399
Are you sure about this?

112
00:07:59,519 --> 00:08:00,600
Mr. Wan was right.

113
00:08:01,439 --> 00:08:03,160
I've had enough of fighting and killing.

114
00:08:04,519 --> 00:08:05,639
I want to be a businessman.

115
00:08:09,319 --> 00:08:10,480
Chief Xiao's home address

116
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:11,639
and all the places he frequents,

117
00:08:11,639 --> 00:08:12,639
I know all of them.

118
00:08:12,959 --> 00:08:14,959
But the guy has no weaknesses.

119
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:17,639
F-Forget weaknesses.

120
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:20,040
He d-doesn't even have any hobbies.

121
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:21,199
Exactly.

122
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:22,360
He has a happy family,

123
00:08:22,519 --> 00:08:24,199
(Loyalty)
and won't even accept small gifts.

124
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:26,040
What do we do, Boss Lin?

125
00:08:27,399 --> 00:08:28,600
The cleaner someone looks,

126
00:08:29,439 --> 00:08:30,720
the dirtier the secret they're hiding.

127
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:33,639
What's his schedule the next few days?

128
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:35,440
In two days,

129
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:37,200
he's attending some municipal meeting.

130
00:08:37,600 --> 00:08:38,960
He'll stay at Palace Hotel for two days.

131
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:40,639
Follow him.

132
00:08:41,519 --> 00:08:41,960
(Loyalty)
Got it.

133
00:08:42,279 --> 00:08:42,720
Okay.

134
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:48,440
Boss Lin.

135
00:08:49,159 --> 00:08:50,039
He's right here.

136
00:09:01,639 --> 00:09:02,559
Chief Xiao.

137
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:04,799
Having fun?

138
00:09:04,799 --> 00:09:05,679
Who are you?

139
00:09:06,679 --> 00:09:07,480
Come on.

140
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:08,519
Look this way.

141
00:09:09,679 --> 00:09:11,440
Quite the stamina, Chief Xiao.

142
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:12,240
Who are you?

143
00:09:12,799 --> 00:09:13,519
What do you want?

144
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:15,080
Stop taking pictures!

145
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:22,240
He's covering his face in this one.

146
00:09:22,679 --> 00:09:23,759
The angle's bad.

147
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:24,840
Take another one.

148
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:26,320
Get them to smile more.

149
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:27,879
Get closer. Take a few more.

150
00:09:27,879 --> 00:09:28,799
Smile.

151
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:30,399
Look happy.

152
00:09:30,919 --> 00:09:31,720
Who are you people?

153
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:34,120
We need you to take a call.

154
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:36,120
What call?

155
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:38,799
Who are you people?

156
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:39,919
What do you want?

157
00:09:39,919 --> 00:09:40,879
Take it.

158
00:09:44,039 --> 00:09:44,840
(I'm Xiao Yuanshan, Land Administration)
Read it.

159
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:46,040
(I resign for health reasons.)

160
00:09:48,879 --> 00:09:49,919
You're all in this together.

161
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:01,720
We were able to arrest Dongshan Tai

162
00:10:02,039 --> 00:10:03,399
and seize a large quantity of drugs

163
00:10:03,919 --> 00:10:04,519
because...

164
00:10:04,519 --> 00:10:05,159
I know.

165
00:10:05,879 --> 00:10:07,279
He deserves credit for that.

166
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:10,279
He's done great work these past years.

167
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:12,279
But

168
00:10:12,600 --> 00:10:15,080
he went undercover after graduation.

169
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:18,720
He's never worked a day
as a regular cop.

170
00:10:19,600 --> 00:10:20,399
Look at him.

171
00:10:20,919 --> 00:10:22,279
He still hides whenever he sees a cop.

172
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:24,639
How can he stay with the department?

173
00:10:25,559 --> 00:10:26,639
No department

174
00:10:27,679 --> 00:10:28,960
would be an easy fit.

175
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:49,440
Here. Have some.

176
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:51,159
Thank you, Officer Luo.

177
00:10:56,720 --> 00:10:59,320
The Deputy Commissioner was briefed.

178
00:10:59,879 --> 00:11:01,759
To help you get used to police work,

179
00:11:02,159 --> 00:11:04,720
you'll start at a station for a while.

180
00:11:06,200 --> 00:11:06,600
Don't worry.

181
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:08,120
We'll transfer you back soon.

182
00:11:13,000 --> 00:11:13,600
Officer Luo,

183
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:16,759
could I be assigned to the station

184
00:11:16,759 --> 00:11:17,840
near Rongxing Building?

185
00:11:18,600 --> 00:11:20,000
That's pretty remote.

186
00:11:20,519 --> 00:11:21,840
Patrol duty is tough there.

187
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:23,000
I know.

188
00:11:23,919 --> 00:11:25,279
I just want to keep myself

189
00:11:26,600 --> 00:11:27,159
busy

190
00:11:27,799 --> 00:11:29,480
and get used to being a cop.

191
00:11:31,000 --> 00:11:32,200
You have a friend there?

192
00:11:35,399 --> 00:11:36,000
No problem.

193
00:11:41,120 --> 00:11:43,960
(Breaking News: Chief Xiao Resigns)

194
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:51,200
You handled this very well.

195
00:11:51,679 --> 00:11:53,399
Thank you for the opportunity, Mr. Wan.

196
00:11:58,519 --> 00:11:59,000
By the way,

197
00:12:00,159 --> 00:12:01,080
I have a project.

198
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:04,000
The shantytown on Haiping Road

199
00:12:04,399 --> 00:12:05,559
is about to be redeveloped.

200
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:10,120
But there's a lot to deal with first.

201
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:12,240
Do you know the area?

202
00:12:18,440 --> 00:12:19,120
Pretty well.

203
00:12:20,559 --> 00:12:21,039
(That place)

204
00:12:22,559 --> 00:12:24,600
(is where my brother and I grew up.)

205
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:25,799
(Come here.)

206
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:29,440
(Look at these drawings.)

207
00:12:30,039 --> 00:12:31,240
(My brother drew all of them.)

208
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:35,240
The place is a real mess now.

209
00:12:37,159 --> 00:12:39,000
It has to be cleared before work starts.

210
00:12:41,799 --> 00:12:42,879
Come on. Let's drink.

211
00:12:43,480 --> 00:12:43,840
Okay.

212
00:13:00,440 --> 00:13:01,320
Fu.

213
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:03,039
I came to see you.

214
00:13:35,679 --> 00:13:37,639
No forced evictions!

215
00:13:37,919 --> 00:13:39,440
Protect our homes!

216
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:41,480
(No Forced Evictions)
No forced evictions!

217
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:43,480
Protect our homes!

218
00:13:43,960 --> 00:13:45,759
No forced evictions!

219
00:13:45,919 --> 00:13:47,480
(No Forced Evictions)
Protect our homes!

220
00:13:47,960 --> 00:13:50,080
No forced evictions!

221
00:13:50,080 --> 00:13:50,559
Protect our homes!

222
00:13:50,559 --> 00:13:51,639
Beat them!

223
00:14:12,159 --> 00:14:15,360
Get down! Get down!

224
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:17,600
Come on. Put your thumbprints here.

225
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:20,879
Hurry up! Move!

226
00:14:21,279 --> 00:14:21,639
Come on.

227
00:14:22,519 --> 00:14:23,240
Hurry up.

228
00:14:24,039 --> 00:14:24,440
Move!

229
00:14:25,639 --> 00:14:26,000
Hurry!

230
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:26,720
Put your thumbprints here.

231
00:14:34,159 --> 00:14:35,639
I-It's done.

232
00:14:38,320 --> 00:14:39,679
Th-They all signed.

233
00:14:40,639 --> 00:14:41,200
Where's Lin?

234
00:14:41,399 --> 00:14:42,360
Boss Lin had business to handle.

235
00:14:42,639 --> 00:14:43,440
He sent us here.

236
00:14:44,639 --> 00:14:46,960
Lin handled this very well.

237
00:15:06,879 --> 00:15:08,159
Lin.

238
00:15:11,159 --> 00:15:14,399
Come home early.

239
00:15:15,879 --> 00:15:16,720
Remember to close the door.

240
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:23,159
Close the door.

241
00:16:04,720 --> 00:16:05,440
What are you drawing?

242
00:16:06,519 --> 00:16:08,639
A big house.

243
00:16:10,440 --> 00:16:10,759
Fu.

244
00:16:11,320 --> 00:16:12,440
When I have money,

245
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:15,159
we'll

246
00:16:15,879 --> 00:16:17,039
live in a big house.

247
00:16:17,720 --> 00:16:18,720
We'll live like kings.

248
00:16:19,620 --> 00:16:20,680
Okay.
